WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.777
"My bird stamp is lost forever!" cried Bird.

2
00:00:16.778 --> 00:00:29.848
Kip felt terrible.

3
00:00:29.849 --> 00:00:34.472
"I think I'll send a note to Bird," he thought.

4
00:00:34.473 --> 00:00:51.720
Kip went up to his hole.

5
00:00:51.721 --> 00:00:58.704
He found a pencil and some paper.

6
00:00:58.705 --> 00:01:02.080
"Dear Bird," he wrote.

7
00:01:02.081 --> 00:01:07.335
"I'm sorry your bird stamp is lost forever.

8
00:01:07.336 --> 00:01:22.090
Your friend, Kip."

9
00:01:22.091 --> 00:01:26.492
Kip put the note into an envelope.

10
00:01:26.493 --> 00:01:40.241
"Now I just need a stamp," he said.

11
00:01:40.242 --> 00:01:42.577
"This one looks good."

12
00:01:42.578 --> 00:01:57.939
Kip put the stamp on the envelope.

13
00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:10.197
He put the envelope in the mailbox.

14
00:02:10.198 --> 00:02:23.286
The next day Bird got the note.

15
00:02:23.287 --> 00:02:31.799
She cheered when she read it.

16
00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:40.273
"Yay!" cried Bird.

17
00:02:40.274 --> 00:02:48.180
"Thank you, Kip!"

18
00:02:48.181 --> 00:02:51.161
"You got my note?" asked Kip.

19
00:02:51.162 --> 00:02:53.583
"Yes," said Bird.

20
00:02:53.584 --> 00:02:57.891
"And I got my bird stamp back!"

21
00:02:57.892 --> 00:03:00.415
"Where was it?" asked Kip.

22
00:03:00.416 --> 00:03:03.860
Bird laughed.

23
00:03:03.861 --> 00:03:18.952
"You put it on the envelope, silly!"

